text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', "As long as you control eight or more lands, Woodborn Behemoth gets +4/+4 and has trample. (It can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)", 'At the beginning of combat on your turn, you may have target creature get +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you control five or more lands, put four +1/+1 counters on Scute Mob.', 'Bloodthirst 1 (If an opponent was dealt damage this turn, this creature enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it.)\\nFirst strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)', 'Bloodthirst 2 (If an opponent was dealt damage this turn, this creature enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.)', "Bloodthirst 2 (If an opponent was dealt damage this turn, this creature enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.)\\nMenace (This creature can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", 'Bloodthirst 3 (If an opponent was dealt damage this turn, this creature enters the battlefield with three +1/+1 counters on it.)\\nFlying\\n{R}{R}{R}: Return Skarrgan Firebird from your graveyard to your hand. Activate only if an opponent was dealt damage this turn.', 'Blue spells and red spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.\\n{1}{B}: Regenerate Nightscape Familiar.', "Chandra's Outrage deals 4 damage to target creature and 2 damage to that creature's controller.", 'Choose a color. Sudden Demise deals X damage to each creature of the chosen color.', 'Crumbling Necropolis enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {U}, {B}, or {R}.', 'Deathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may have target creature block Turntimber Basilisk this turn if able.', 'Deathtouch\\nWhenever another nontoken creature dies, you may draw a card.', 'Destroy target creature or planeswalker.', 'Destroy target nonblack creature.', 'Destroy two target nonblack creatures. You lose 5 life.', 'Double strike', 'Dragonskull Summit enters the battlefield tapped unless you control a Swamp or a Mountain.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {R}.', 'Drowned Catacomb enters the battlefield tapped unless you control an Island or a Swamp.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}.', "During your turn, your opponents can't cast spells or activate abilities of artifacts, creatures, or enchantments.", 'Each player draws two cards.', 'Each player mills two cards. Then you put a creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has "Whenever this creature attacks, tap target creature defending player controls."', "Enchant creature\\nWhen Hammerhand enters the battlefield, target creature can't block this turn.\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has haste.", "Enchant creature\\nYou control enchanted creature.\\nDiscard two cards: Soul Ransom's controller sacrifices it, then draws two cards. Only your opponents may activate this ability.", "Enchant land\\nEnchanted land is a 6/4 green Elemental creature. It's still a land.\\nWhen enchanted land dies, return that card to its owner's hand.", 'Equipped creature gets +1/+1.\\nWhenever equipped creature attacks, you may search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.\\nEquip {2}', 'Exile target tapped creature.', 'Fertilid enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{1}{G}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Fertilid: Target player searches their library for a basic land card, puts it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffles.', 'Fiery Fall deals 5 damage to target creature.\\nBasic landcycling {1}{R} ({1}{R}, Discard this card: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', 'First strike', "First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)\\nLifelink (Damage dealt by this creature also causes you to gain that much life.)\\nFiendslayer Paladin can't be the target of black or red spells your opponents control.", 'First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)\\nWhenever Lightwielder Paladin deals combat damage to a player, you may exile target black or red permanent that player controls.', 'First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)\\nWhenever Odric, Master Tactician and at least three other creatures attack, you choose which creatures block this combat and how those creatures block.', 'First strike\\nWhenever Precinct Captain deals combat damage to a player, create a 1/1 white Soldier creature token.', 'Flash\\nWhen Dualcaster Mage enters the battlefield, copy target instant or sorcery spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.', 'Flying (This creature can\'t be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\\nWhen Aegis Angel enters the battlefield, another target permanent gains indestructible for as long as you control Aegis Angel. (Effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy it. A creature with indestructible can\'t be destroyed by damage.)', 'Flying, deathtouch, lifelink', 'Flying, deathtouch\\nWhen Baleful Strix enters the battlefield, draw a card.', 'Flying, trample\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, each player loses 1 life. Put a +1/+1 counter on Blood Tyrant for each 1 life lost this way.\\nWhenever a player loses the game, put five +1/+1 counters on Blood Tyrant.', 'Flying, vigilance, lifelink', "Flying\\nAt the beginning of each opponent's end step, that player chooses up to two creatures they control, then sacrifices the rest.", 'Flying\\nDiscard a card: Prognostic Sphinx gains hexproof until end of turn. Tap it.\\nWhenever Prognostic Sphinx attacks, scry 3.', "Flying\\nHaste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)\\nWhenever an opponent is dealt damage by a red instant or sorcery spell you control or by a red planeswalker you control, return Chandra's Phoenix from your graveyard to your hand.", 'Flying\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, Windrider Eel gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', "Flying\\nShroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\\nYou may look at the top card of your library any time.", 'Flying\\nWhen Deathbringer Regent enters the battlefield, if you cast it from your hand and there are five or more other creatures on the battlefield, destroy all other creatures.', 'Flying\\nWhen Expedition Raptor enters the battlefield, support 2. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two other target creatures.)', "Flying\\nWhen Flickerwisp enters the battlefield, exile another target permanent. Return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.", "Flying\\nWhen Icefall Regent enters the battlefield, tap target creature an opponent controls. That creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step for as long as you control Icefall Regent.\\nSpells your opponents cast that target Icefall Regent cost {2} more to cast.", 'Flying\\nWhen Overseer of the Damned enters the battlefield, you may destroy target creature.\\nWhenever a nontoken creature an opponent controls dies, create a tapped 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', 'Gain control of target creature. Untap that creature. It gains haste until end of turn. Sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step.', 'If an opponent controls seven or more lands, this spell costs {6} less to cast.\\nFlying\\n{R}: Avatar of Fury gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, choose one —\\n• Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\\n• You gain 2 life.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may put a quest counter on Ior Ruin Expedition.\\nRemove three quest counters from Ior Ruin Expedition and sacrifice it: Draw two cards.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may put a quest counter on Khalni Heart Expedition.\\nRemove three quest counters from Khalni Heart Expedition and sacrifice it: Search your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Lightning Bolt deals 3 damage to any target.', 'Search your library for up to two basic land cards, reveal those cards, put one onto the battlefield tapped and the other into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Searing Spear deals 3 damage to any target.', "Smoldering Spires enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Smoldering Spires enters the battlefield, target creature can't block this turn.\\n{T}: Add {R}.", 'Support 2. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two target creatures.)\\nDraw a card.', 'Target creature gets +1/+2 and gains reach until end of turn. Untap it. (A creature with reach can block creatures with flying.)', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 and gains lifelink until end of turn. (Damage dealt by the creature also causes its controller to gain that much life.)', 'Target opponent sacrifices a creature, discards three cards, then loses 5 life. You return a creature card from your graveyard to your hand, draw three cards, then gain 5 life.', 'Target player draws three cards. Then that player discards two cards unless they discard a land card.', 'Target player gains 8 life.\\nBasic landcycling {1}{G} ({1}{G}, Discard this card: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', 'Trample\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on Oran-Rief Hydra. If that land is a Forest, put two +1/+1 counters on Oran-Rief Hydra instead.', 'Trample\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may create a 4/4 green Beast creature token.', 'Until end of turn, target creature gets +3/+3 and gains trample and "Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, draw that many cards."', 'Up to two target creatures each get +1/+0 and gain first strike until end of turn.', 'Up to two target creatures each get +2/+2 and gain trample until end of turn.', 'Vigilance\\nWhenever Sun Titan enters the battlefield or attacks, you may return target permanent card with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'Volcanic Geyser deals X damage to any target.', 'When Doomed Traveler dies, create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying.', 'When Flametongue Kavu enters the battlefield, it deals 4 damage to target creature.', 'When Relief Captain enters the battlefield, support 3. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to three other target creatures.)', 'When Thragtusk enters the battlefield, you gain 5 life.\\nWhen Thragtusk leaves the battlefield, create a 3/3 green Beast creature token.', 'Whenever a player casts a spell, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Forgotten Ancient.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may move any number of +1/+1 counters from Forgotten Ancient onto other creatures.', 'Whenever another creature with power 2 or less enters the battlefield under your control, you may pay {1}. If you do, draw a card.', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Guttersnipe deals 2 damage to each opponent.', 'You may play an additional land this turn.\\nDraw a card.', "[+1]: Chandra, Pyromaster deals 1 damage to target player or planeswalker and 1 damage to up to one target creature that player or that planeswalker's controller controls. That creature can't block this turn.\\n[0]: Exile the top card of your library. You may play it this turn.\\n[−7]: Exile the top ten cards of your library. Choose an instant or sorcery card exiled this way and copy it three times. You may cast the copies without paying their mana costs.", "[+1]: Target land you control becomes a 4/4 Elemental creature with trample. It's still a land.\\n[+1]: Untap up to four target Forests.\\n[−7]: Search your library for any number of basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield, then shuffle. Those lands become 4/4 Elemental creatures with trample. They're still lands.", "[+2]: During target opponent's next turn, creatures that player controls attack Gideon Jura if able.\\n[−2]: Destroy target tapped creature.\\n[0]: Until end of turn, Gideon Jura becomes a 6/6 Human Soldier creature that's still a planeswalker. Prevent all damage that would be dealt to him this turn.", "[+3]: Destroy target noncreature permanent.\\n[−2]: Gain control of target creature.\\n[−9]: Nicol Bolas, Planeswalker deals 7 damage to target player or planeswalker. That player or that planeswalker's controller discards seven cards, then sacrifices seven permanents.", '{1}{R}{R}: Put a blaze counter on target land without a blaze counter on it. For as long as that land has a blaze counter on it, it has "At the beginning of your upkeep, this land deals 1 damage to you." (The land continues to burn after Obsidian Fireheart has left the battlefield.)', '{R}, {T}, Exile two cards from your graveyard: Grim Lavamancer deals 2 damage to any target.', '{R}: Inferno Titan gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\nWhenever Inferno Titan enters the battlefield or attacks, it deals 3 damage divided as you choose among one, two, or three targets.', '{R}: Untap Torchling.\\n{R}: Target creature blocks Torchling this turn if able.\\n{R}: Change the target of target spell that targets only Torchling.\\n{1}: Torchling gets +1/-1 until end of turn.\\n{1}: Torchling gets -1/+1 until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Grixis Panorama: Search your library for a basic Island, Swamp, or Mountain card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {R}. Talisman of Indulgence deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}. Talisman of Dominance deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {U}, {B}, or {R}.', '{T}: Target attacking creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{T}: Target player draws a card, then discards a card.', '{W}, {T}: Tap target creature.']
flavor: ['"Always carry two spears."\\n—Mokgar, Kalonian hunter', '"Arise. You have been anointed by the light. Go forth and fight without fear, for you shall be victorious."', '"Fear holds no place in faith\'s battle plan."', '"Fools dig for water, corpses, or gold. The earth\'s real treasure is far deeper."', '"For dim-witted, thick-skulled genetic mutants, they have pretty good aim."\\n—Sisay, captain of the *Weatherlight*', '"Four parts molten bronze, yes . . . one part frozen mercury, yes, yes . . . but then what?"', '"He is judge, jury, and executioner because he killed them all."\\n—Bishop Cawle of Elgaud', '"I could see in the other mage\'s eyes that he\'d thought of it too. Then it became a race to exploit the knowledge first."', '"In these halls there is no pass or fail. Your true test comes with the first full moon."', '"In troubled times, we all need someone to watch our back."', '"It has been my experience that disasters like to strike in pairs."', '"My faith is stronger than fang, claw, or mindless hunger."', '"Sea Gate may have fallen, but we still stand. We still fight."\\n—Gideon Jura', '"Show your enemies as much mercy as they would show you."\\n—Surrak, the Hunt Caller', '"Survival rule 781: There are always more scute bugs."\\n—Zurdi, goblin shortcutter', '"The best spot to hook one is right behind the gills."\\n—Rana Cloudwake, kor skyfisher', '"The common folk call it the breaking of the crust or the spilling of fire. Geomancers call it target practice."\\n—Ryda, geomancer', '"The end is justified in being mean. Or something like that."', '"The essence of a lawful society is swift deterrence."', '"The most elegant solutions are found in nature. You just have to know where to look."', '"There is power in abandon, but far more in control."\\n—Warden Hixus, to Kytheon', '"They say the ruins of Sedraxis were once a shining capital in Vithia. Now it is a blight, a place to be avoided by the living."\\n—Olcot, Rider of Joffik', '"When the land is angry, so are they."\\n—Nissa Revane', '"Why would I kill you all? Who then would be left to worship me?"', '"Your superstitions and mumblings are useless chaff before my righteousness."', 'A blazing sun that never sets.', 'All seeds share a common bond, calling to each other across infinity.', "An explorer's reward is a view of tomorrow's possibilities.", 'As they fought the Eldrazi, many vampires learned to live among humans. Others were unable to make the adjustment.', 'Blood is holy to those whose god is War.', 'Chandra never believed in using her "inside voice."', "Dwarves have an instinct for repair, an inherent understanding of how systems work, and a reputation for fearlessness. They're perfect candidates for the Fair's emergency response team.", "He vowed he would never rest until he reached his destination. He doesn't know how right he was.", 'He wants to watch Ravnica burn, one soul at a time.', 'His prowess gives the guildless hope that they can hold out against tyranny.', 'Idealism fits him better than his armor.', "If you want to wreak havoc above, sometimes it's best to look below.", 'In Rakdos-controlled neighborhoods, everyone is part of the show.', 'In the Skyfang Mountains, one misstep can mean the end of an entire clan.', "It carries the hopes of Zendikar's embattled wilds on its mighty boughs.", 'It\'s hard to shout "Shields up!" with a javelin in your chest.', 'Its beak rends flesh and bone, exposing the tender marrow of dream.', 'Its blood is life. Its body is growth.', 'Its wings disturb more than air.', 'Like most features of Grixis, the obelisks that remain from the time of Alara now exist only for dark exploitation.', "Nicol Bolas doesn't distinguish between servants and victims.", 'Progress comes at a price.', 'Some of the eleven minotaur clans of Mirtiin are expert crafters and learned philosophers. Others just like to hit stuff.', 'Sometimes gestures of support are small. Sometimes not.', "Sometimes you die a glorious death with your sword held high. Sometimes you're just target practice.", "The blade glows only for Zendikar's chosen.", "The demon had flown past the reach of Erebos's whip but not the point of the sun god's spear.", 'The shaman rattles not to inspire a battle fury but to drown out the shrieks of those fleeing the Eldrazi.', "The sparkmage shrieked, calling on the rage of the storms of his youth. To his surprise, the sky responded with a fierce energy he'd never thought to see again.", 'The void is without substance but cuts like steel.', 'There is always a greater power.', 'There is no height above Grixis that is free from the stench of death.', "To be counted among the warriors of Setessa's Leina Tower, you must not fear death, only failure."]
